rgin-bottom: 10px;"&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/3678394450/" title="photo sharing"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm4.static.flickr.com/3638/3678394450_bb94f1c0f8_m.jpg" alt="" style="border: solid 2px #000000;" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 0px;"&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/3678394450/"&gt;The Secret Of Monkey Island on DosBox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Originally uploaded by &lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/people/doodle_m/"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Finally got round to installing DosBox on my Ubuntu laptop, now I need the time to play Monkey Island.&lt;br clear="all" /&gt;</description></item><item><title>Embed Flash games on your site with Heyzap</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/embed-flash-games-on-your-site-with/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2009 18:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/embed-flash-games-on-your-site-with/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 30 of this post&amp;rsquo;s 31 links are now broken — mostly dead 2008–2013 feed-syndication infrastructure (FeedBurner, Gawker, AOL&amp;rsquo;s old blog network, Pheedo, Yahoo Pipes). Left as originally published.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;div style="margin: 0px 2px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 1px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="padding: 4px; background-color: #c3d9ff;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="margin:0px 3px;font-family:sans-serif"&gt;Sent to you by Alastair via Google Reader:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 1px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 2px; padding-top: